      "name": "组合_等权投票",
      "description": "Top3 单因子等权投票组合",
      "code": "# MACD量能背离\nmacd_hist_prev = macd_hist.shift(1)\nsig0 = np.where((macd_hist > macd_hist_prev) & (close > ma5), 1, 0)\nsig0 = pd.Series(sig0, index=close.index).shift(1).fillna(0)\n\n# 双底放量\nsig1 = np.where((close <= boll_down * 1.03) & (vol_ratio > 1.2), 1, 0)\nsig1 = pd.Series(sig1, index=close.index).shift(1).fillna(0)\n\n# 量价背离\nret = close.pct_change()\nsig2 = np.where((ret > 0) & (vol_ratio < 0.7), -1, 0)\nsig2 = pd.Series(sig2, index=close.index).shift(1).fillna(0)\n\nvote = sig0 + sig1 + sig2\nsignal = np.where(vote >= 2, 1, np.where(vote <= -2, -1, 0))\nsignal = pd.Series(signal, index=close.index).shift(1).fillna(0)",
